+
+/* The day you are on: a marigold frame, a glow under it and a filled status
+   chip. The other day steps back, and comes forward again under a pointer or
+   a keyboard, so it still reads as something to press. */
+.pg-day.is-here{border-color:var(--marigold);background:rgba(232,163,59,.12);
